{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t一名26歲倉務員在元朗一個倉庫被3隻狗追撲及襲擊，小腿被咬傷，清醒送往博愛醫院診治。漁護署人員事後帶走涉事狗隻檢查。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n現場是錦壆路104號，男事主早上約8時到倉庫上班，現場養有3隻狗，他突然被襲擊，咬人的唐狗約1.2米長。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:25.542542+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T02:14:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T09:38:46.237090+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:49.119291+00:00","content_hash":"a92c51cbc748c8e35b2bd08acc56876d34d767d9ec557cc00f5619d6b050f9ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}